+## openspec/changes/add-askdata-spring-boot-starter/proposal.md
+
+- Source: openspec/changes/add-askdata-spring-boot-starter/proposal.md
+- Lines: 1-43
+- SHA256: 143575daee36a65aeecbf63d46c73a4297fff1535f81cbac7be5dd9e97f79902
